msgid "Hmph.  Looks like junk to me. <yawn> I suppose I could give you oh, say, %27 gold pieces for it."
msgstr "Hum. C’est de la camelote. <bâillement> Je crois que je pourrais vous en donner, disons, %27 pièces d’or."

