msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Staff, Elsie Pederton, can be found in the Bracada Desert, on a ridge in the southwest region."
msgstr "Elsie Pederton, Maître de l'art du Bâton, se trouve au sud-ouest le Désert de Bracada."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:130
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The ultimate teacher in the ways of the Staff, Jillian Mithrit, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.  Her home is in the city in the northeast."
msgstr "Jillian Mithrit vous enseignera l'ultime maîtrise du Bâton. Elle réside dans le territoire des Elfes, dans la cité au nord-est d'Avlee."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:131
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Sword, Tugor Slicer, maintains his residence in a small village in the western region of Deyja."
msgstr "L'instructeur des Maîtres de l'Epée, Tugor Slicer, réside dans un petit village de l'ouest de Deyja."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:132
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Sword, Chadric Townsaver, can be found in a small village in Welnin, just south of the city of Harmondale."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître de l'Epée, Chadric Townsaver, habite un petit village de Welnin, au sud de la cité d'Harmondale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:133
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master tutor of the Dagger, Aznog Slasher, can be found in the northern region of Nighon."
msgstr "Le tuteur des Maîtres de la Dague, Aznog Slasher, habite dans le nord de Nighon."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:134
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Dagger, Token Fist, can be found in city of Tidewater in Tatalia.  Rumor has it that the Master Thief in the depths of the Erathian Sewers beneath the capitol city of Steadwick can also instruct at this level."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître de la Dague, Token Fist, habite la cité de Tidewater à Tatalia. D'après la rumeur, le Maître Voleur qui réside dans les Egouts d'Erathia dans la cité de Steadwick est également capable de vous enseigner la grande maîtrise de la dague."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:135
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master Instructor of all that is the Axe, Dalin Keenedge, can be found in the northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr "L'instructeur des Maîtres de la Hache, Dalin Keenedge, réside au nord-est de la Cité de Pierre."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:136
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The ultimate teacher of the uses of the Axe, Karn Stonecleaver, can be found in the snowy heights of the northeast region of Tatalia."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître de la Hache, Karn Stonecleaver, habite les monts enneigés de la région du nord-est de Tatalia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:137
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master teacher, Claderin Silverpoint, can be found in the northeast section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean Forest. There he will further you knowledge of the Spear."
msgstr "L'enseignant des Maîtres à la Lance, Claderin Silverpoint, habite au nord-est de la cité de Pierpont dans les territoires elfes de la Forêt de Tulare."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:138
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Spear, Selene Falconeye, makes her home in the northeast corner of Stone City."
msgstr "La Grand Maître de la Lance, Selene Falconeye, habite au nord-est de la Cité de Pierre."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:139
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master tutor of the Bow, Lanshee Ravensight, lives in the northern regions of Nighon."
msgstr "Le tuteur des Maîtres à l'Arc, Lanshee Ravensight, réside dans le nord de Nighon."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:140
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Bow, Cardric the Steady, can be found just to the southeast of the castle in the city of Harmondale."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître de l'Arc, Cardric le Précis, habite au sud-est du château dans la cité d'Harmondale."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:141
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master instructor of the Mace, Brother Rothham, can be found in the southern region of the swamps of Tatalia."
msgstr "L'instructeur des Maîtres à la Masse, le Frère Rothham, demeure dans le sud-est de la zone marécageuse de Tatalia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:142
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Mace, Patwin Felburn, teaches from his home in the goblin village found in the eastern area of Deyja."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître de la Masse, Patwin Felburn, enseigne chez lui dans le village gobelin qui se trouve dans l'est de Deyja."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:143
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "My Master, Isram Gallowswell, can be found in the snowy heights of the northeast area of Tatalia. You will gain further instruction in the Shield there."
msgstr "Mon Maître, Isram Gallowswell, demeure dans les monts enneigés du nord-est de Tatalia. Il vous instruira dans l'art du Bouclier."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:144
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of the Shield, Fedwin Smithson, can be found on the eastern island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr "Le Grand Maître du Bouclier, Fedwin Smithson, habite dans l'île la plus orientale de l'archipel d'Evenmorn."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:145
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Master tutor of Leather Armor, Rabisa Neldon, lives in the northern regions of Nighon."
msgstr "Le tuteur des Maîtres en armures de Cuir, Rabisa Neldon, demeure dans le nord de Nighon."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_AutonoteTxt.txt.py:342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/AUTONOTE.TXT.py:146
msgctxt "autonote or awards"
msgid "The Grandmaster of Leather Armor, Miyon the Quick, can be found in the eastern section of the city of Pierpont in the elven region of the Tularean Forest."
msgstr "Grand Maître en armures de Cuir, Miyon le Vif, demeure dans le quartier est de la cité de Pierpont dans la Forêt de Tulare."

