#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:16
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:17
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:17
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:19
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This weapon may once have been of some quality, though it would be hard to tell through the apparent years of corrosion."
msgstr "Cette arme a peut-être eu jadis quelque qualité, mais il est difficile d’en juger à la vue de la corrosion accumulée depuis des années."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Goblin Scimitar"
msgstr "Cimeterre de gobelin"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:18
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:20
msgctxt "items"
msgid "After the Gowdar Deep Goblins were wiped off the face of Jadame in the Goblin-Ogre Wars, thousands of these weapons appeared on the common market."
msgstr "Décimés lors des guerres entre gobelins et ogres, les gobelins des Profondeurs de Gowdar ont disparu de Jadame. Ces armes sont alors apparues par milliers sur le marché des communs."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:21
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:16
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas regnan"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:19
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:21
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Issued to Regnan seamen as a basic side arm, these blades have gained a sturdy reputation."
msgstr "Distribuées aux marins regnans comme simples armes courtes, ces lames ont acquis une solide réputation."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Falchion"
msgstr "Cimeterre regnan"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:20
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:22
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The extremely forward balance of this weapon's blade gives it extra striking power, but requires great strength and skill from its wielder."
msgstr "Le poids concentré très en avant de la lame de cette arme lui confère une puissance de frappe supplémentaire, mais celui qui s’en sert doit faire preuve de beaucoup de force et d’habileté."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Captain's Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas de capitaine"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:21
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:23
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Given to Regnan captains upon gaining their first command, these superior weapons help them to dominate their foes and subordinate."
msgstr "Remises aux capitaines regnans à l’obtention de leur premier poste de commandement, ces armes supérieures les aident à dominer leurs ennemis et leurs subordonnés."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:22
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:24
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crude Dagger"
msgstr "Dague rudimentaire"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:22
