msgctxt "items"
msgid "Axe"
msgstr "Hache"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:32
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:34
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Not much more than fire-hardened sticks lashed to sharp stones, these crude implements make for poor tools and weapons."
msgstr "Guère plus que des bâtons durcis au feu et ficelés à des pierres coupantes, ces instruments rudimentaires font de piètres outils et de mauvaises armes."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battle Hatchet"
msgstr "Hachette de combat"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:33
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:35
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Often carried by mounted knights as a secondary arm, battle hatchets are preferred by some who carry them to the exclusion to any sword."
msgstr "Les chevaliers montés portent souvent les hachettes de combat en guise d’armes secondaires. Certains préfèrent les porter à l’exclusion de toute autre épée."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Battleaxe"
msgstr "Hache de combat"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:34
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:36
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These heavy axes are meant to be carried one-handed for use against both armored and unarmored foes."
msgstr "Ces lourdes haches se portent d’une main et servent à attaquer des ennemis avec ou sans armure."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dwarven Battleaxe"
msgstr "Hache de combat de nain"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:35
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:37
msgctxt "items"
msgid "While the blacksmiths of the Jadamean Dark Dwarves are not as skilled as their Erathian counterparts, they still produce a product superior to most of what is otherwise available."
msgstr "Les forgerons des nains de l’Ombre de Jadame ne sont pas aussi habiles que leurs homologues d’Erathia. Pourtant, ils fabriquent une arme supérieure à la plupart des autres."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur Battleaxe"
msgstr "Hache de minotaure"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:36
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:38
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forged by the Minotaurs for their wars with the Ogres, these axes are forged of a secret alloy formula. Their edges are difficult to dull and even harder to sharpen."
msgstr "Forgées par les minotaures pour leurs guerres avec les ogres, ces haches sont faites d’un alliage à la formule secrète. Il est difficile d’en émousser les tranchants et encore plus de les affûter."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:37
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:38
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:39
