#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:42
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:43
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:44
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Trident"
msgstr "Trident"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:52
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:54
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Though a common farming implement, this hayfork is of sturdy construction and could be an excellent, if improvised, weapon."
msgstr "Simple outil agricole, cette fourche à foin est toutefois solide et pourrait s’avérer au besoin une arme excellente."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Infantry Fork"
msgstr "Fourche d’infanterie"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:53
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:55
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A highly specialized piece of equipment intended to equalize contests between foot soldiers and mounted, armored opponents, these modified spears are effective if slightly clumsy weapons."
msgstr "Instruments à usage très spécial conçus pour égaliser les chances entre les fantassins et leurs adversaires montés en armure, ces lances modifiées sont efficaces, mais peu maniables."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lizardman Trident"
msgstr "Trident d’homme-lézard"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:54
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:56
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The blacksmiths on the Dagger Wound Islands craft a wide variety of spearheads. This trident is one of their most unusual designs. The barbed tines cause extra damage during straight thrusting attacks."
msgstr "Les forgerons des îles de la Plaie de la Dague fabriquent une grande variété de fers de lance. Ce trident est l’une de leurs inventions les plus originales. Les dents acérées infligent des dégâts supplémentaires lors des attaques directes."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Trident"
msgstr "Trident regnan"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:55
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:57
msgctxt "items"
msgid "No Regnan ship leaves port without a cache of tridents. Boarding attacks against their galleys seldom succeed against massed walls of their erudine tines."
msgstr "Aucun navire regnan ne quitte le port sans une réserve de tridents. Les abordages lancés contre leurs galères réussissent rarement, repoussés par les rangs serrés de leurs dents d’érudine."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Triton Trident"
msgstr "Trident de triton"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:56
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:58
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The first thing one notices when first handling this trident is that it is unusually cool to the touch. The second is a sense that the dragon turtle bone tines seem to seek vulnerabilities in their targets' defenses as if guided by an unseen hand."
msgstr "La première fois qu’on manipule ce trident, on remarque d’abord qu’il est étrangement froid au toucher. On a ensuite l’impression que les dents en os de tortue-dragon recherchent les points faibles dans les défenses de leurs cibles, comme guidées par une main invisible."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hunting Bow"
msgstr "Arc de chasse"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:515
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:534
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:545
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bow"
msgstr "Arc"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:57
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:59
msgctxt "items"
msgid "These lightweight bows of simple construction are meant for bringing down small game animals - not for direct combat. "
msgstr "Ces arcs légers de construction sommaire servent à abattre du petit gibier. Ils ne sont pas faits pour le combat direct. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Recurve Bow"
msgstr "Arc recourbé"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:58
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:60
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Recurved bowstaves allows an archer to pull a heavier bow than they might otherwise be able to. Greater pull weight means greater arrow speed for increase range and damage."
msgstr "Les arcs recourbés permettent aux archers de les bander davantage que les autres. Une plus forte tension de l’arc permet une vitesse accrue de la flèche, donc une plus longue portée et plus de dégâts."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Snakewood Bow"
msgstr "Arc en bois de couleuvre"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:59
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:61
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The human soldiers of Enroth carry bows made from the native snakewood tree. The strong, flexible wood makes a sturdy bow."
msgstr "Les soldats humains d’Enroth portent des arcs en bois de couleuvre, arbre indigène. Ce bois solide et souple permet de fabriquer des arcs résistants."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Warbow"
msgstr "Arc de guerre elfique"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:60
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:62
msgctxt "items"
msgid "By laminating together layers of wood, steel, and bone the bowsmiths of Alvar have created a bow of perfect balance, strength and accuracy. The process consumes a lot of time, craft and expensive materials which explains the steep price these bows command."
msgstr "En laminant ensemble des couches de bois, d’acier et d’os, les fabricants d’arcs d’Alvar ont créé un arc dont l’équilibre, la force et la précision sont parfaits. Ce procédé exige beaucoup de temps, d’expérience et de matériaux coûteux. Ces arcs sont donc très chers."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Devilbone Bow"
msgstr "Arc en os du diable"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:61
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:63
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dark Elven bowsmiths have discovered that unusual characteristics of the Kreegan spinal column make it the best material for heavy bowstaves. A clever arrangement of composite pulleys make it possible for those of less than superhuman strength to pull these mighty weapons."
msgstr "Les elfes de l’Ombre fabricants d’arcs ont découvert que les propriétés singulières de la colonne vertébrale des Kreegans en faisaient le meilleur matériau de fabrication des arcs lourds. Un judicieux arrangement de poulies composites permet aux êtres de force ordinaire de bander ces puissants arcs."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Light Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète légère"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:62
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:64
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:65
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:66
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:850
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:851
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:852
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1650
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1651
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1652
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:67
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:68
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:535
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:49
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:50
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:51
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:50
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:51
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:52
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:62
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:64
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Because of their ease of use, crossbows like these are stockpiled in militia armories everywhere. Their low pull strength and mediocre workmanship however, make them only moderately effective."
msgstr "En raison de leur facilité d’utilisation, des stocks entiers d’arbalètes de ce genre sont disponibles dans toutes les armureries de gardes. Pourtant, leur faible force de tension et leur fabrication médiocre les rendent modérément efficaces."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Blood Drop Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète de Goutte de sang"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:63
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:65
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A light crossbow of good quality, these weapons feature a grooved table, basic sights and a smooth releasing nut."
msgstr "Arbalètes légères de bonne qualité, ces armes comportent un plateau rainuré, des mires simples et une détente souple."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hunting Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète de chasse"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:64
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:66
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Built for use in the field, this medium crossbow is designed for hunting, but is equally effective as a battle weapon."
msgstr "Conçue pour une utilisation sur le terrain, cette arbalète moyenne est faite pour la chasse mais elle est tout aussi efficace comme arme de combat."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Caravaner's Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète de caravanier"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:65
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Merchants of Alvar like to see their caravan guards well armed. This well-crafted heavy crossbow has a cranked drawing mechanism."
msgstr "Les marchands d’Alvar aiment voir les gardes de leurs caravanes bien armés. Cette solide arbalète est équipée d’un mécanisme de tension à manivelle."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Regnan Crossbow"
msgstr "Arbalète regnane"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:66
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:68
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The pirates of Regna Island have spent centuries perfecting their crossbow design. The resulting weapon has a crystal lensed sight and bowstaves of pure stalt - which would make the bow impossible to cock if not for the crank draw of erudine alloy."
msgstr "Les pirates de l’île de Regna ont passé des siècles à perfectionner la conception de leurs arbalètes. Le fruit de leur travail est une arme comportant une mire à lentille de cristal et des arcs en stalt massif, qui rendraient l’arc impossible à bander sans la manivelle en alliage d’érudine."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:67
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sturdy Mace"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:67
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:69
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:70
