msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloak"
msgstr "Cape"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:123
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:125
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This warm cloak of dyed wool also offers a small amount of protection from weapon attacks."
msgstr "Cette chaude cape de laine teintée protège également un peu des attaques à main armée."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:124
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Moon Temple Cloak"
msgstr "Cape du Temple de la Lune"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:124
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:126
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The blue dye used to color the glove leather cloaks worn by Moon Temple clerics is derived from the frond petal flowers which grow only in the Mount Nighon region of Erathia."
msgstr "La teinture bleue utilisée pour colorer les capes en peau portées par les clercs du Temple de la Lune est tirée des fleurs à pétales de frondes qui poussent uniquement dans la région du Mont Nighon d’Erathia."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Alvar Cloak"
msgstr "Cape d’Alvar"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:125
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:127
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Made in Alvar, cloaks of this quality are often seen on the shoulders of the more wealthy members of the Alvarian Merchant Guild."
msgstr "Fabriquées à Alvar, les capes de cette qualité sont souvent portées par les riches membres de la Guilde des marchands d’Alvar."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:126
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Necromancer Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de nécromancien"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:126
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:128
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clearly a cloak made for a practitioner of the dark arts. This fine cloak is worked with arcane designs embroidered in darkened silver thread."
msgstr "De toute évidence, il s’agit d’une cape destinée aux adeptes des arts occultes. Cette cape raffinée est ornée de motifs obscurs, brodés en fil d’argent ombré."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de vampire"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:127
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:129
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This high collared, jet black cloak of wyvern leather is lined in red velvet--a style much favored by the elder vampires of Shadowspire."
msgstr "Cette cape noir de jais à haut col, en cuir de vouivre, est doublée de velours rouge, style très en vogue chez les vampires aînés de Shadowspire."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:128
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:130
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Leather Gloves"
msgstr "Gants en cuir"

