msgid "Smooth stone without specific color."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Prophecies of the Sun"
msgstr "Prophéties du Soleil"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:627
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The writing inside this book reads like the ranting of a madman. Still, someone must have thought highly of it. The text is entirely hand scribed in a florid style. Inset illuminations bring to life scenes from the story which are, in turn, disturbing, outlandish or seemingly drawn from nightmare."
msgstr "Objet de quête : le texte de ce livre semble le délire d’un fou. Pourtant, quelqu’un a dû y voir une grande valeur. Il est entièrement manuscrit dans un style plein de fioritures. Des enluminures insérées en cartouche font vivre des scènes de l’histoire, tour à tour troublantes, bizarres ou tirées d’un possible cauchemar."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Remains of Korbu"
msgstr "Dépouille de Korbu"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Remains"
msgstr "Dépouille"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:628
#: mm8/Data/10LocLANG.EnglishT/ITEMS.txt.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The remains of Korbu who some claim was the most powerful vampire of all times. He's not much to look at now, however. His skeleton has been almost completely dismantled--either by design or the ravages of time, and a wooden stake is nestled entirely within the ribcage."
msgstr "Objet de quête : la Dépouille de Korbu qui, selon certains, était le vampire le plus puissant de tous les temps. Il offre désormais un bien piètre spectacle. Son squelette a été presque entièrement démantelé, soit intentionnellement, soit par les ravages du temps, et un pieu en bois est enfoncé intégralement dans la cage thoracique."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:629
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1404
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1418
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:603
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lich Jar"
msgstr "Jarre de Liche"

