msgctxt "items"
msgid "Relic"
msgstr "Relique"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1317
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:516
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +150, Intellect -40, Personality -40, Speed -40) It is said that Mash was the answer to the First Ogre's prayer to the Gods for a weapon that would make it stronger than anything else.  Annoyed, the Gods cursed the First Ogre with Mash, and all Ogres have since borne the mark of that act--strong, but slow, dull, and stupid.  In any event, Mash is yours now."
msgstr "(+ 150 de Force, -40 d'Intelligence, -40 de Personnalité, -40 de Vitesse) On chuchote que cet Ecraseur fut la réponse des dieux à la prière du Premier Ogre implorant une arme qui le hausserait au-dessus des autres mortels. Agacés, les dieux donnèrent à l'Ogre cette arme maudite qui a depuis marqué de son sceau tous les Ogres : la force leur fut accordée, certes, mais mêlée de stupidité, de lenteur, de maladresse. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ethric's Staff"
msgstr "Bâton d'Ethric"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1318
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:517
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Dark Magic, Meditation skill +15, Decrease Hit Points over time, Evil) Much more a tool than a weapon, Ethric's Staff was fashioned by the world's first lich--Ethric the Mad.  The staff magnifies Dark magic, drawing from the life force of its user.  Since Ethric's life force was magically sustained, this wasn't a problem for him.  Mortals, however, will slowly feel their life force drain away while they hold the staff."
msgstr "(Magie de l'Ombre, +15 de Méditation, amoindrit les Points de Vie, Mal) Plus proche de l'outil que de l'arme, le Bâton d'Ethric fut façonné par la première Liche connue, Ethric le Fou. Le Bâton amplifie la Magie de l'Ombre, suçant les forces vives de l'utilisateur. C'était sans risque pour Ethric, dont la vie était alimentée par magie, mais les mortels qui utilisent le Bâton sentiront peu à peu leurs forces décroître. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hareck's Leather"
msgstr "Cuir d'Hareck"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1319
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:518
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Stealing skill +5, Disarm skill +5, Water Walking, Luck +50, All Resistances -10)This leather armor was specially built by the Regnan armory for Hareck the First, Lord of Regna, and Emperor of the Endless Ocean.  The armor did everything a glorified pirate like Hareck could hope for, except protect him from poison.  The mighty first Emperor of Regna died just after dinner while wearing the armor, poisoned by his wife's hand. "
msgstr "(+5 de Vol à la Tire, +5 Désamorcer, Marcher sur l'Eau, +50 de Chance, -10 toutes Protections) Cette Armure de Cuir fut spécialement conçue par les armureries de Regna pour Hareck I, Seigneur de Regna, Empereur de la Mer sans Fin. L'armure remplit tous les offices voulus par son propriétaire, sauf le protéger contre l'empoisonnement. Le puissant Empereur de Regna mourut son armure sur le dos, des mains perfides de sa femme. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Old Nick"
msgstr "Vieux Nick"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1320
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:519
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Disarm Skill +5, 8 points of Poison damage, Elf Slaying, Evil) Secretly passed from one Assassin to another for centuries, Old Nick happily vanished from history's sight during the Battle for Morning--a joint Human-Elvish attack on the Assassin's guild nearly 200 years ago.  It is said that Old Nick has killed more people than the Plague.  Now that you've found this evil weapon, you're going to throw it down a well...aren't you?"
msgstr "(+5 Désamorcer, 8 points de dégâts Poison, Tueur d'Elfes, Mal) Passant depuis des siècles d'un Assassin à l'autre, Vieux Nick disparut enfin pendant la Bataille pour le Matin : une attaque d'Elfes et d'Humains alliés contre la Guilde des Assassins il y a près de 200 ans. On prétend que Vieux Nick a tué davantage que la Peste. Si vous avez la plus petite once de sens moral, vous jetterez cette arme au fond d'un puits... "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Amuck"
msgstr "Amuck"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1321
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:520
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +100, Endurance +100, Armor Class -15) The original name of Amuck has been lost in time, but the blade retains a magically keen edge and all of its original power.  Fantastic strength and vitality are conferred upon the owner at the expense of a proper sense of fear.  Wielders of Amuck don't much bother dodging blows in battle."
msgstr "(+100 de Force, +100 d'Endurance, -15 de Classe d'Armure) L'origine du nom d'Amuck se perd dans la nuit des temps, mais la lame a conservé son tranchant magique et sa puissance. Une force et une vitalité extraordinaire enrichissent le propriétaire mais il perd tout instinct de conservation, ne cherchant plus à esquiver les coups pendant la bataille. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Glory Shield"
msgstr "Bouclier de Gloire"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1322
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:521
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Spirit Magic, Shield skill +5, Body Resistance -10, Mind Resistance -10) One of five such shields known to exist, the Glory Shield was built during the Time of Wonders.  It was especially tuned to promote Spirit magic, but that same attunement leaves the wielder somewhat open to Mind and Body based attacks."
msgstr "(Magie de l'Esprit, +5 de Bouclier, -10 de Protection contre le Corps, -10 de Protection contre l'Esprit) Le Bouclier de Gloire est l'un des cinq objets connus de ce type. Il fut conçu pendant les Temps des Merveilles pour promouvoir la Magie de l'Esprit, mais laisse l'utilisateur vulnérable aux attaques du Corps et de l'Esprit. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Kelebrim"
msgstr "Kelebrim"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1323
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:522
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immunity to stone condition, Half damage from missile attacks, Endurance +50, Earth Resistance -30) One of the first shields to issue from the Kelebrim Foundry, this one bears the simple stamp \"Kelebrim\" on the inside under the hand strap.  It has very powerful enchantments meant to protect from Medusa gazes, but like many grand enchantments, it comes with a flaw.  Kelebrim weakens it's owners resistance to Earth magic."
msgstr "(Immunité contre la Pétrification, Dégâts des attaques de projectiles réduits de moitié, +50 d'Endurance, -30 de Protection contre la Terre) Ce bouclier est l'un des premiers a avoir été forgé dans les fonderies de Kelebrim, et ne porte pour marque que ce simple nom. Il possède des enchantements très puissants destinés à protéger contre le regard de la Méduse, mais cette magie n'est pas sans défaut : Kelebrim amenuise la protection contre la magie de la Terre. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Taledon's Helm"
msgstr "Casque de Taledon"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1324
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:523
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Light Magic, Personality +15, Might +15, Luck -40, Good)Owned by Taledon, Divine High Priest and High Holy Conduit of the Church of the Sun from 870 A.S., this powerful helm probably contributed to his untimely death in 881.  It is said that an object may take so much enchantment--try to put too much in, and something negative squeezes out.  In this case, the negative made the wearer profoundly unlucky.  Taledon, arguably the most powerful figure of his time, veteran diplomat, soldier, and priest, was crushed beneath the wheels of a runaway peasant's wagon while crossing the street in Steadwick."
msgstr "(Magie de la Lumière, +15 de Personnalité, +15 de Force, -40 de Chance, Bien) Ce casque puissant fut possédé par Taledon, Grand-Prêtre Divin et Guide Sacré de l'Eglise du Soleil à partir de 870 après le Silence, et contribua sans doute à sa mort en 881. On dit qu'à vouloir exagérer les enchantements sur un objet, on finit par obtenir des effets désastreux : Taledon, probablement la personnalité la plus forte de son temps, diplomate expérimenté, combattant et prêtre respecté, fut écrasé par les roues d'une charrette de paysan dans les rues de Steadwick."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scholar's Cap"
msgstr "Casquette de l'Erudit"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1325
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:524
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Learning skill +15, Endurance -50) The Scholar's Cap vastly improves the ability of the mind to absorb and retain experiences.  The effect is so intense that wearers frequently forget to care for their bodies while swimming in the sea of their thoughts.  "
msgstr "(+15 d'Apprentissage, -50 d'Endurance) La Casquette de l'Erudit améliore considérablement l'aptitude de l'esprit à absorber et à assimiler les expériences. Son effet est si puissant que les porteurs en oublient souvent de se préoccuper de leur corps tandis qu'ils nagent dans les vastes océans du savoir. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Phynaxian Crown"
msgstr "Couronne Phynaxienne"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1326
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:525
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Fire Magic, Water Resistance +50, Personality +30, Armor Class -20) This is the lost (WAS the lost) crown of the short lived Empire of Phynax.  When worn, the crown's jewels smolder with   barely restrained Fire magic, and cast reddish light upon the face of the wearer.  The crown amplifies any skill in Fire magic the wearer may have, and fiercely resists water based attacks."
msgstr "(Magie du Feu, +50 de Protection contre l'Eau, +30 de Personnalité, -20 de Classe d'Armure) Vous venez de retrouver la Couronne perdue de l'éphémère empire de Phynax. Lorsqu'on la porte, les joyaux de la couronne brillent comme des braises par la magie du Feu, et jettent des lueurs rougeâtres sur le visage du porteur. La couronne accroît toutes les compétences en Magie du Feu et résiste merveilleusement aux attaques par l'élément liquide. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Titan's Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture du Titan"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1327
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:526
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Might +75, Speed -40) Like so many similar items, the Titan's Belt increases the might of its wearer at the expense of speed.  The only difference with this relic is the magnitude of the trade off."
msgstr "(+75 de Puissance, -40 de Vitesse) Comme la plupart des objets de cette sorte, la Ceinture du Titan accroît la puissance de son possesseur au détriment de sa vitesse. Mais cette ceinture pourrait valoir beaucoup sur le marché des échanges."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Twilight"
msgstr "Crépuscule"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1328
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:527
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Speed +50, Luck +50, All resistances -15, Evil) The sinister Twilight Cloak has been used by spies and assassins for centuries.  The nature of the enchantment is so beneficial to those professions that the loss of magical resistance is easily overlooked."
msgstr "(+50 de Vitesse, +50 de Chance, -15 à toutes les Protections, Mal) La sinistre Cape Crépuscule est l'alliée des espions et des assassins depuis des centaines d'années. La nature de son enchantement est si bénéfique à ces professions qu'elle compense largement la diminution des protections magiques."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ania Selving"
msgstr "Ania Selving"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1329
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:528
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Accuracy +150, Bow skill +5, Armor Class -25) Master smith Ivan Selving named this crossbow after his only daughter Ania, calling it his second best creation ever.  Archers using this crossbow rarely miss their targets, but their concentration and slow, careful movements make them easy targets in turn."
msgstr "(+150 de Précision, +5 à l'Arc, -25 de Classe d'Armure) Le Maître Forgeron Ivan Selving baptisa cette arbalète d'après sa fille unique Ania, toutes deux étant selon lui ses plus belles réussites. Les archers dotés de cette arme manquent rarement leur cible, mais leurs mouvements précautionneux et leur lenteur en font des objectifs faciles. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "Justice"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1330
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:529
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Undead slaying, of Mind magic, of Body magic, -40 Speed, Good) Forged in the halcyon days at the beginning of the Church of the Sun, Justice is a powerful weapon for Good.  At the cost of a speed, Justice is one of the mightiest relics a Paladin or Cleric can wield for the Path of Light."
msgstr "(Tueur de Mort-Vivants, Magie de l'Esprit, Magie du Corps, -40 de Vitesse, Bien) Forgée aux jours d'Halcyon lors de la fondation de l'Eglise du Soleil, Justice est une arme puissante dévouée au Bien. C'est la relique la plus puissante que peuvent posséder un Paladin ou un Clerc sur le Chemin de la Lumière, mais c'est au détriment de leur vitesse. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mekorig's Hammer"
msgstr "Marteau de Mekorig"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1331
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:530
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Spirit magic, Might +75, Air Resistance -50) This is the very hammer the great Mekorig the Blind used to turn out so much of the world's finest enchanted equipment during his many years as Master of the Mekorig Foundry.  The hammer's connection to the elements leaves the wielder vulnerable to elemental magic, but it is a small price to pay for the enhanced Self ability and Might the hammer provides."
msgstr "(Magie de l'Esprit, +75 de Force, -50 de Protection contre l'Air) C'est le marteau que le grand Mekorig l'Aveugle utilisait pour forger les armes enchantées les plus remarquables lorsqu'il dirigeait la fonderie Mekorig. L'utiliser rend vulnérable aux Magies Elémentaires, mais c'est un faible prix à payer pour bénéficier de ses avantages. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hermes' Sandals"
msgstr "Sandales d'Hermès"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1440
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sandals"
msgstr "Sandales"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1332
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:531
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate HP, Regenerate SP, Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged sandals confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr "(+100 de Vitesse, +50 de Précision, +50 de Protection contre l'Air, Régénère les PdV et les PdS, Poids Plume permanent) On dit que la Sandale Ailée serait tombée du pied d'un dieu. Elle confère en tout cas un grand pouvoir à son utilisateur. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Cloak of the Sheep"
msgstr "Cape de la Brebis"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1333
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:532
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Immunity to disease, insanity, paralysis, poison, sleep, and stone conditions, Intellect -20, Personality -20) The cloak worn by the High Priest of Baa, though useful it seems to sap the will of the wearer slowly away."
msgstr "(Immunité contre la Maladie, la Folie, la Paralysie, les Poisons, le Sommeil, la Pétrification, -20 d'Intelligence, -20 de Personnalité) Quoique puissante, la cape du Grand-Prêtre de Baa semble saper peu à peu la volonté de son possesseur. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elfbane"
msgstr "Griffe de l'Elfe"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Two-Handed Sword"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1334
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:533
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Of Shielding, Elf Slayer, Goblin) This sword was created by the goblins for their Chief at the time, Grogar.  Unfortunately, the goblins lost the war and Elfbane was lost for quite some time.  Enchanted to both slay elves, and protect its wielder from arrows, Elfbane truly lives up to its name.  A curious side effect of the enchantment renders the weapon unusable by all but a goblin."
msgstr "(Bouclier, Tueur d'Elfes, Gobelin) Cette épée fut conçue par les Gobelins pour leur chef de guerre d'alors, Grogar. Malheureusement les Gobelins perdirent leur combat et Griffe de l'Elfe fut longtemps perdue. Enchantée pour être plus efficace contre les Elfes et pour protéger son possesseur contre les flèches, elle n'est utilisable que par les Gobelins."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Mind's Eye"
msgstr "Œil de l'Esprit"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1335
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:534
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+15 Intellect, +15 Personality, Regenerate SP, Human) Mind's Eye was created by Mekorig for the Great Druid, Larette Weisman.  While enhancing both intellect and personality, Mind's Eye regenerates the wearer's mana and also provides head protection.  Unfortunately, Mind's Eye will only fit on the head of a human."
msgstr "(+15 d'Intelligence, +15 de Personnalité, Régénère les PdS, Humain) L'Oeil de l'Esprit fut créé par Mekorig pour le Grand Druide Larette Weisman. Tout en renforçant l'Intelligence et la Personnalité, l'Oeil de l'Esprit régénère la Mana de l'utilisateur et procure une protection de haute qualité. Seul un Humain peut le porter. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elven Chainmail"
msgstr "Cotte de Mailles Elfique"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Chain Mail"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1336
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:535
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(of Recovery, +15 Speed, +15 Accuracy, Elven) Elven chainmail was more common before the wars against the humans and the goblins.  Centuries of combat combined with the degradation of armorsmithing skills have reduced the number of sets of Elven Chainmail to almost none.  The effect of using lighter materials and custom designing the armor to only fit elves grants the wearer more freedom of movement, allowing faster, more accurate attacks."
msgstr "(Récupération, +15 de Vitesse, +15 de Précision, Elfes) Les Cottes de mailles elfiques étaient plus communes avant la guerre contre les Nains et les Humains. Des siècles de combats et la perte progressive des talents de forge ont réduit le nombre de ces armures à presque rien. Des matériaux légers et un dessin spécialement adapté aux Elfes donnent au possesseur de l'armure plus de liberté de mouvement et permet des attaques plus rapides et plus précises. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Forge Gauntlets"
msgstr "Gantelets de Forge"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1337
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:536
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+30 Fire Resistance, +15 Might, +15 Endurance, Dwarven) Forge Gauntlets were created by Mekorig for his assistants to aid them in helping him.  Extending the already amazing dwarven might and endurance, the gauntlets also grant exceptional resistance to fire-- necessary in a forge as hot as Mekorig's."
msgstr "(+30 de Protection contre le Feu, +15 de Force, +15 d'Endurance, Nain) Les Gantelets de Forge furent dessinés par Mekorig pour ses assistants. Ils augmentent la force et l'endurance déjà ahurissantes des Nains. Dans une forge aussi réputée que celle de Mekorig, ce n'est pas inutile. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Hero's Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture du Héros"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Artifact Belt"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1338
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:537
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+5 Armsmaster skill, +15 Might, Regenerate HP, Male) Designed for Saint Perci, this belt confers martial prowess, exceptional strength, and regeneration.  Saint Perci used the belt quite extensively, but even with its help he wasn't able to stave off death at the hands of the Wromthrax the dragon."
msgstr "(+5 de Maîtres d'Armes, +15 de Force, Régénère les PdV, Masculin) Conçue pour Saint Perci, cette ceinture autorise des prouesses martiales, confère une force exceptionnelle et une grande capacité de régénération. Saint Perci utilisa beaucoup la ceinture, mais même avec son aide il ne survécut pas à sa rencontre avec Wromthrax le Dragon. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady's Escort"
msgstr "Garde des Dames"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1339
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:538
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(Water walking, Feather falling, of Protection, Female) A magical 'escort' designed by the mage Terrax for one of his female friends who had to travel quite far to reach him.  The ring protects the wearer from elements, falling, and drowning.  Unfortunately, she traveled to Erathia and the ring disappeared soon after."
msgstr "(Marcher sur l'Eau, Poids Plume, Protection, féminin) Escorte magique dessinée par le Mage Terrax pour le voyage lointain d'une de ses amies, cet anneau protège son porteur des éléments, des chutes et de la noyade. Malheureusement, la jeune femme partit pour Erathia et l'objet disparut peu après. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Clanker's Amulet"
msgstr "Amulette de Clanker"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Amulet"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1340
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:539
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A mighty tool for alchemists, this amulet was the secret to Clanker's success.  "
msgstr "Outil utile pour les Alchimistes, cette amulette fut le secret du succès de Clanker. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lieutenant's Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas du Lieutenant"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Cutlass"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1341
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:540
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine steel weapon, this cutlass is sharpened and ready for action."
msgstr "Ce coutelas est une arme d'acier aiguisée pour l'action. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Medusa's Mirror"
msgstr "Regard de la Méduse"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1342
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:541
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The user of this mirror is completely immune to stoning effects.  Would have been nice to have this earlier.  "
msgstr "L'utilisateur de ce miroir est protégé contre la Pétrification. Il eut été bon de le posséder plus tôt. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lady Carmine's Dagger"
msgstr "Dague de Dame Carmine"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Dagger"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1343
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:542
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Nicks and scratches on this nasty blade show that it has seen plenty of action.  "
msgstr "Cette mauvaise lame émoussée a dû connaître bien des combats. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Villain's Blade"
msgstr "Fleuret du Traître"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Sword"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1344
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:543
msgctxt "items"
msgid "William Setag would frequently slay prisoners with this blade to heal his own minor cuts and bruises.  The weapon is cold to the touch, and tingles in your hand."
msgstr "William Setag assassinait régulièrement ses prisonniers avec cette arme afin de soigner ses propres blessures. Son contact est froid et désagréable."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The Perfect Bow"
msgstr "Arc Parfait"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1345
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:544
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Although of high quality, this bow doesn't seem to perform nearly as well as it should.  The string is too hard to pull back, it doesn't remain steady enough while aiming, and it seems a little off-balance."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : quoique de bonne qualité, cet arc n'a pas la perfection qu'on attendrait de lui. La corde est trop rigide, l'arme trop instable pour permettre une visée efficace. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1346
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:545
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This bow seems to know its wielder's strength and adjusts itself accordingly.  You never have to struggle to pull the string back, and it's always easy to hold your shot until you're ready to fire.  Dozens of small advantages like this in the design of the bow make for the finest weapon of its type you have ever seen."
msgstr "Cet arc semble jauger la force de son utilisateur et s'y adapter de lui-même. Il est toujours facile de tirer la corde en arrière et de rester en attente jusqu'à ce que vous soyez prêt à tirer. Des dizaines de petits avantages de cette sorte rendent cette arme très supérieure à toutes les autres du même type. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Shadow's Mask"
msgstr "Masque des Ombres"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Helm"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1347
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:546
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A mask designed to hide the identity of the wearer, it has also been magically enhanced to offer good protection and to aid thiefly pursuits."
msgstr "Ce masque est conçu pour cacher l'identité de son possesseur. Il a aussi été enchanté pour offrir une meilleure protection."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ghost Ring"
msgstr "Anneau Fantôme"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1348
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:547
msgctxt "items"
msgid "An odd ring that feels strangely warm to the touch.  It enhances the wearers connection to the spirit."
msgstr "Ce vieil anneau semble étrangement chaud au toucher. Il améliore la capacité de connexion à l'Esprit. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Faerie Ring"
msgstr "Anneau Féerique"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1349
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:548
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A rare and very powerful ring made by Faeries.  Few mortals ever see such as this!"
msgstr "Cet anneau très rare et très puissant fut fabriqué par les Fées. Peu de mortels ont eu la chance de voir son équivalent. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Sun Cloak"
msgstr "Cape du Soleil"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Cloak"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1350
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:549
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Sun.  No more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the High Council of the Sun."
msgstr "Cette cape désigne le plus haut rang permis à un Prêtre du Soleil. Neuf de ces capes seulement furent fabriquées, une pour chaque membre du Grand Conseil du Soleil. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Moon Cloak"
msgstr "Cape de la Lune"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1351
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:550
msgctxt "items"
msgid "This cloak signifies the highest rank attainable by a Priest of the Moon.  No more than nine of these cloaks were ever made--one for each member of the High Council of the Moon."
msgstr "Cette cape désigne le plus haut rang permis à un Prêtre de la Lune. Neuf de ces capes seulement furent fabriquées, une pour chaque membre du Grand Conseil de la Lune. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zokarr's Axe"
msgstr "Hache de Zokarr"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1352
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:551
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The family heirloom of the Zokarr monarchs.  This weapon grants the wielder a greater affinity with earth magic."
msgstr "Cette arme, accroissant les affinités de son possesseur avec la Magie de la Terre, est l'héritage de famille royale Zokarr. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vampire's Cape"
msgstr "Cape du Vampire"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1353
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:552
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Small wonder such a cloak as this would be found on a vampire.  The cloak prevents sunlight from reaching the body, but is unable to protect the face."
msgstr "Il n'est pas étonnant qu'une telle cape soit trouvée sur le dos d'un vampire. Elle protège le corps des rayons du soleil, mais laisse la tête à découvert. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Minotaur's Axe"
msgstr "Hache du Minotaure"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Special Axe"
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1354
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:553
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A fine trophy!  The axe is made for a Minotaur and is very heavy, but the magical strength it imparts makes it easy to use for anyone."
msgstr "Joli trophée ! Cette hache fut dessinée pour un Minotaure, elle est très lourde mais suffisamment enchantée pour être facilement utilisée par tout le monde. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Grognard's Cutlass"
msgstr "Coutelas du Grognard"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1355
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:554
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A finely crafted and specially enchanted goblin weapon.  Though originally crafted to slay elves, this weapon does a perfectly good job on members of the other races."
msgstr "Cette arme finement épurée fut spécialement enchantée par les Gobelins. D'abord conçue pour tuer des Elfes, elle est parfaitement efficace contre toutes les autres races. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1373
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:572
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The DeathBlade"
msgstr "Lame Fatale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1373
msgctxt "items"
msgid "For testing… remove before final release."
msgstr ""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:602
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Heart of the Wood"
msgstr "Cœur du Bois"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1403
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:602
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A jewel like none you have ever seen."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : un joyau comme vous n'en avez jamais vu. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1404
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:603
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A jar holding your physical and spiritual essence.  Don't lose the jar."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : une jarre contenant votre essence physique et spirituelle. Ne la perdez pas."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Case of Soul Jars"
msgstr "Caisse de Jarres de Liche"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Case of Jars"
msgstr "Caisse de Jarres"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1405
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:604
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A rosewood case lovingly crafted to contain a set of Lich Jars.  This case appears to be full."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : un coffret de bois de rose amoureusement conçu pour contenir des jarres de liche. Il paraît plein. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Parson's Quill"
msgstr "Plume de Parson"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quill"
msgstr "Plume"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1406
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:605
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  King Parson's hand employed this quill to sign the treaty ending the first Timber War."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : le roi Parson a signé le traité concluant la Guerre du Bois avec cette plume. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wetsuit"
msgstr "Combinaison de Plongée"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Strange Suit"
msgstr "Costume étrange"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1407
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:606
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This environmental suit handles not only respiration, but protection from the extreme pressure of deep sea diving.  It does not look like any other items may be worn while wearing the suit.  You must remove ALL equipment to wear the suit."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette combinaison permet de respirer sous l'eau en protégeant contre les pressions à basse profondeur. Il ne semble pas qu'on puisse porter cette combinaison avec d'autres objets, vous devez abandonner tout équipement pour porter cette tenue."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Oscillation Overthruster"
msgstr "Surchargeur d'Oscillation"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Ancient Part"
msgstr "Objet Ancien"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1408
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:607
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This device has no visible symbols or parts.  Why it is so valuable is beyond your comprehension."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cet objet n'a pas de marque ni de caractéristique notable, vous ne comprendrez jamais pourquoi il vaut autant. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Signet Ring"
msgstr "Chevalière"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1409
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:608
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A highly stylized 'D' and 'P' intertwined by a snake with a crown above its head are engraved into the face of this ring.  This must certainly be Davrick's."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : deux lettres finement ouvragées mêlées à un serpent couronné sont gravées sur cet anneau. Il s'agit probablement de l'anneau de Davrick. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1410
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Letter from Johann Kerrid to the Faerie King"
msgstr "Lettre de Johann Kerrid au Roi des Fées"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1410
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:609
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A letter from Johann Kerrid to the Faerie King.  Opening a sealed letter is in the poorest of taste, and would be frowned upon by both parties."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une lettre de Johann Kerrid au roi des Fées. Ouvrir une lettre scellée est du pire mauvais goût et pourrait indisposer l'expéditeur comme le destinataire. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1411
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1412
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1413
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1414
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1415
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1416
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:610
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:611
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:612
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:613
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:614
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:615
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A sealed letter."
msgstr "Lettre cachetée."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1417
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:616
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Letter from Norbert Thrush to Lord Markham"
msgstr "Lettre de Norbert Thrush au Seigneur Markham"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1417
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:616
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A letter from Norbert Thrush to Lord Markham.  Opening a sealed letter is in the poorest of taste, and would be frowned upon by both parties."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une lettre de Norbert Thrush au Seigneur Markham. Ouvrir une lettre cachetée est du pire mauvais goûte et pourrait fâcher l'expéditeur comme le destinataire. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1418
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:617
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Empty Jar"
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une jarre vide. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1419
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Genie Lamp"
msgstr "Lampe Magique"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1419
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lamp"
msgstr "Lampe"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1419
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:618
msgctxt "items"
msgid "The genies captured in these lamps will usually reward those who set them free, though sometimes they take cruel delight in punishing the first living beings they encounter.  To use the genie lamp, pick the lamp up and left-click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr "Les Génies détenus dans cette lampe récompenseront sans doute ceux qui les libéreront mais il y a un risque qu'ils punissent le premier être vivant qu'ils verront. Pour utiliser la lampe, prenez-la et cliquez avec le bouton droit de la souris sur le portrait de votre personnage dans l'inventaire. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1420
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:619
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Knight Statuette"
msgstr "Statuette de Chevalier"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1420
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1421
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1422
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:619
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:620
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Statuette"
msgstr "Statuette"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1420
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:619
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A small statuette of a knightly figure.  The statuette seems to radiate a faint magic."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une petite statuette de chevalier. Elle semble irradier une faible aura magique. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1421
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2074
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:620
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:456
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Eagle Statuette"
msgstr "Statuette d'Aigle"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1421
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:620
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A small statuette of a proud eagle.  The statuette seems to radiate a faint magic."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une petite statuette d'aigle arrogant. Elle semble irradier une faible aura magique."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1422
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Angel Statuette"
msgstr "Statuette d'Ange"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1422
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:621
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A small statuette of an angel.  The statuette seems to radiate a faint magic."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une petite statuette d'ange. Elle irradie une faible aura magique. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1423
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:622
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Big Tapestry"
msgstr "Grande Tapisserie"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1423
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:622
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tapestry"
msgstr "Tapisserie"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1423
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:622
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A large tapestry, suitable for hanging in castles."
msgstr "C'est une grande tapisserie destinée aux murs des châteaux. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1424
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:623
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Angel Statue Painting"
msgstr "Peinture de Statue d'Ange"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1424
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1425
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1426
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:623
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:624
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:625
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Painting"
msgstr "Peinture"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1424
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:623
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A painting of the angel fountain in the courtyard of Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est la peinture de la statue de l'ange situé dans les jardins du Château Ironfist."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1425
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:624
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Archibald Ironfist Painting"
msgstr "Portrait d'Archibald Ironfist"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1425
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:624
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A painting of Archibald Ironfist just prior to his War of Succession in Enroth."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est un portrait d'Archibald Ironfist juste avant la Guerre de Succession d'Enroth."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1426
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:625
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Roland Ironfist Painting"
msgstr "Portrait de Roland Ironfist"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1426
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:625
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A painting of Roland Ironfist just prior to the War of Succession in Enroth."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est une peinture de Roland Ironfist juste avant la Guerre de Succession d'Enroth."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1427
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:626
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Vase"
msgstr "Vase"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1427
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:626
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This small, porcelain vase has been etched with the inscription, \"To Lord Markham, for a great job in the war, Queen Catherine.\""
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : ce petit vase de porcelaine est gravé de l'inscription \"Pour le Seigneur Markham en souvenir de ses exploits durant la guerre, Reine Catherine.\""

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1428
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Flower (Rose)"
msgstr "Fleur (Rose)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1428
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Flower"
msgstr "Fleur"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1428
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:627
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A red, red, rose."
msgstr "C'est une rose d'un rouge soutenu."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1429
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:628
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Zokarr IV's Skull"
msgstr "Le Crâne de Zokarr IV"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1429
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:2085
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:628
#: mm6/data/10LocLANG.icons/ITEMS.TXT.py:467
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Skull"
msgstr "Crâne"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1429
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:628
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The skull of the old Dwarf King, Zokarr IV.  It doesn't look particularly impressive."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est le crâne du vieux roi des Nains, Zokarr IV. Il n'a pas l'air si impressionnant. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1430
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Thigh Bone"
msgstr "Fémur"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1430
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:629
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A human(?) thigh bone."
msgstr "C'est un fémur, sans doute humain. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1431
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Haldar's Remains"
msgstr "Restes d'Haldar"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1431
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:630
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This strangely shaped jar resists all attempts to open or break.  Haldar apparently doesn't like to be disturbed. "
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette jarre à la forme étrange résiste à toute tentative d'ouverture. Haldar n'aime visiblement pas être dérangé.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1432
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:631
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Elixir"
msgstr "Elixir"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1432
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1453
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:631
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:652
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Bottle"
msgstr "Bouteille"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1432
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:631
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  A glowing elixir of obviously magical properties."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est un élixir phosphorescent aux propriétés magiques. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1433
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Red Apple"
msgstr "Pomme Rouge"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1433
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:632
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Apples like these are produced by trees saturated by magic-- usually in the elven lands of Avlee and the Tularean Forest, though not restricted to these areas.  To use the apple, pick the apple up and left-click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr "Ces pommes-là proviennent d'arbres saturés de magie, généralement plantés dans les terres Elfiques d'Avlee ou de la forêt de Tulare. Pour utiliser cette pomme, prenez-la et cliquez avec le bouton droit de la souris sur le portrait de votre personnage dans l'Inventaire. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1434
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Wealthy Hat"
msgstr "Chapeau d'Apparat"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1434
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:633
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This hat appears to belong to a more affluent member of society, the feather is genuine and the construction is solid.  Unfortunately, it doesn't seem to fit."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : ce chapeau appartient sans doute à un notable, sa plume est superbe et sa confection remarquable. Malheureusement, il ne semble pas à votre taille. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1435
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:634
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lute"
msgstr "Luth"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1435
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1436
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1437
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:634
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:635
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Instrument"
msgstr "Instrument"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1435
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:634
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This lute has been masterfully crafted and lovingly maintained.  This instrument clearly belongs to a Bard."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : ce luth magistralement fabriqué et amoureusement entretenu appartient visiblement à un Barde. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1436
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:635
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Faerie Pipes"
msgstr "Cornemuse Enchantée"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1436
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:635
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Though finely crafted and deceptively simple-looking, these Pipes are quite difficult to play; they seem to have a mind of their own."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette cornemuse est difficile d'usage en dépit de sa belle réalisation et de son apparente simplicité, comme si elle avait sa volonté propre. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1437
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Gryphonheart's Trumpet"
msgstr "Trompe de Gryphonheart"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1437
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:636
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  An artifact from a previous Elf/Human dispute, lost by Terrance Gryphonheart in a daring night-time raid by Elvish forces.  Rumor has it that no army that has fought on the side of this trumpet's music has ever been defeated.  Even if the rumor is false, it will certainly boost morale on either side."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cet objet datant des conflits entre Elfes et Humains fut volé à Terrance Gryphonheart au cours d'un raid audacieux des forces Elfiques. On murmure qu'une armée encouragée par les sonneries de cette trompette ne peut être battue. Même si la rumeur est fausse, ses fanfares seront sûrement bénéfiques au moral. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1438
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:637
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Seashell"
msgstr "Coquillage"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1438
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:637
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: Seashells this large are only found on the beaches of Emerald Island.  One of these might make a nice souvenir of your time here."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : on ne trouve de si impressionnants coquillages que sur les plages de l'Ile d'Emeraude. L'un d'eux pourrait vous faire un joli souvenir. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1439
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Floor Tile (w/ moon insignia)"
msgstr "Dalle (w/ insigne lunaire)"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1439
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Tile"
msgstr "Dalle"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1439
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:638
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: This tile was apparently part of the library in a Temple of the Moon."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette dalle provient visiblement de la bibliothèque du Temple de la Lune. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1440
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Winged Sandals"
msgstr "Sandales Ailées"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1440
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:639
msgctxt "items"
msgid "(+100 Speed, +50 Accuracy, +50 Air Resistance, Regenerate SP and HP over time, and Feather Falling) Rumored to be the footwear of a god, the winged sandals confer enormous power on the wearer."
msgstr "(+100 de Vitesse, +50 de Précision, +50 de Protection contre l'Air, Régénère les PdS et les PdV progressivement, et Poids Plume) On dit qu'il les chaussures d'un dieu. Les Sandales Ailées confèrent un extraordinaire pouvoir à celui qui les porte."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1441
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:640
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Season's Stole"
msgstr "Etole des Saisons"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1441
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:640
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Scarf"
msgstr "Echarpe"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1441
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:640
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item: The Seasons' Stole is worn by priests during seasonal festivities.  Though it doesn't have any direct power, most commonfolk believe it grants luck in the planting or harvest."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : l'Etole des Saisons est portée par les prêtres lors du Sacre des Saisons. Quoique sans pouvoir direct, elle accroîtrait la chance. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1442
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem chest"
msgstr "Cage Thoracique de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1442
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1443
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1444
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1445
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1446
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1447
#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1448
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:641
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:642
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:643
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:644
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:645
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:646
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem part"
msgstr "Elément de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1442
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:641
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The broad torso of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : c'est le torse viril d'un puissant golem. Il faudra sans doute le réassembler avant qu'il ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1443
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:642
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Abbey Normal Golem Head"
msgstr "Tête de Golem d'Abbaye Normale"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1443
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:642
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The dented head of a mighty golem.  It looks a little…strange.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : la tête féroce d'un puissant golem. L'aspect en est un peu étrange. Il faudra sans doute la réassembler avant qu'elle ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1444
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:643
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem head"
msgstr "Tête de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1444
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:643
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The proud head of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : la tête fière d'un puissant golem. Il faudra sans doute la réassembler avant qu'elle ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1445
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:644
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem left leg"
msgstr "Jambe gauche de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1445
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:644
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The massive left leg of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : la jambe gauche trapue d'un puissant golem. Il faudra sans doute la réassembler avant qu'elle ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1446
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:645
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem right leg"
msgstr "Jambe droite de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1446
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:645
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The massive right leg of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : la jambe droite trapue d'un puissant golem. Il faudra sans doute la réassembler avant qu'elle ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1447
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:646
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem right arm"
msgstr "Bras droit de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1447
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:646
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The powerful right arm of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : le puissant bras droit d'un imposant golem. Il faudra sans doute le réassembler avant qu'il ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1448
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Golem left arm"
msgstr "Bras gauche de Golem"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1448
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:647
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  The powerful left arm of a mighty golem.  It appears to require a bit of assembly before being fully functional."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : le puissant bras gauche d'un imposant golem. Il faudra sans doute le réassembler avant qu'il ne soit vraiment efficace."

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1450
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:649
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Dragon Egg"
msgstr "Œuf de Dragon"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1450
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:649
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  Rough, leathery, and strangely warm, this egg appears nearly ready to hatch."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cet œuf imposant semble prêt à éclore. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1451
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:650
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lantern of Light"
msgstr "Lanterne de Lumière"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1451
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:650
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Lantern"
msgstr "Lanterne"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1451
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:650
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This lantern shines with a faint, holy light, though no flame appears to be lit inside."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette lanterne luit d'une faible et sainte lueur quoique aucune flamme ne semble brûler à l'intérieur.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1452
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:651
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Worn Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture Usagée"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1452
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:651
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Quest Item:  This belt is worn to the point where it should only last about an hour.  Hopefully, that will be long enough."
msgstr "Objet de la Quête : cette ceinture a été portée au point qu'elle ne paraît pas pouvoir survivre plus d'une heure. Mais, au fond, cela devrait suffire.  "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1453
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:652
msgctxt "items"
msgid "Temple in a Bottle"
msgstr "Temple dans une Bouteille"

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1453
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:652
msgctxt "items"
msgid "A strangely shaped small building finely crafted inside a glass bottle.  Something about the bottle beckons you inside.  To use, pick the bottle up and click over the picture of your character in the inventory screen."
msgstr "Une petite construction à la forme étrange est subtilement enchâssée dans cette bouteille de verre. Elle possède un étrange pouvoir de fascination. Pour l'utiliser, prenez-la et cliquez avec le bouton droit de la souris sur le portrait de votre personnage. "

#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_ItemsTxt.txt.py:1454
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/ITEMS.TXT.py:653
msgctxt "items"
