#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:57
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid "The magnificent Potion of the Gods increases all seven statistics of a character by 20, once. There are many ways to mix this potion, but all involve ten reagents: four of one type and three of the other two types."
