#: mmmerge/Data/Text localization/LANG_MessageScrolls.txt.py:112
#: mm7/DATA/10LocLANG.events/SCROLL.TXT.py:30
msgctxt "scroll"
msgid " Bill of Sale To:  Schmendrick From:  ACME Golem's  We have made the golem parts per your request.  Unfortunately our delivery service has, misplaced these parts for you.  We are not responsible for any errors by the delivery service.  We do however know where your parts were delivered and you can go about recovering them at your leisure.  1 part was delivered to The Barrow Downs 1 part was delivered to Tatalia 1 part was delivered to Avlee 2 parts were delivered to Deyja 2 heads were delivered to Bracada (as we did not know which model you prefered)"
msgstr "\nActe de Vente\nDe :  Schmendrick\nA :  Golems ACME\n\nNous avons préparé les éléments du golem selon vos instructions. Malheureusement, notre service de livraison n'a pas livré les pièces à l'endroit requis. Nous ne saurions être tenus responsables des erreurs commises par notre service de livraison. Voici la liste des éléments livrés et des lieux de livraison.\n\n1 élément livré aux Collines du Sommeil\n1 élément livré à Tatalia\n1 élément livré à Avlee\n2 éléments livrés à Deyja\n2 têtes livrées à Bracada (nous ne savions pas quel modèle avait votre préférence)"

